<title>FRANCE: Sanofi maintains profit forecast.</title>
<headline>Sanofi maintains profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French pharmaceuticals and beauty products company Sanofi is maintaining its forecast of about 10 percent higher 1996 results after posting nine-month sales in line with its forecasts, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>In 1995, the company 52-percent owned by Elf Aquitaine had a net attributable profit of 1.57 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom ++33 1 4221 5452</p>
